# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads: an ALLOWLIST. Everything is ignored unless listed
# here, so private videos, pose data, experiments, documents, credentials and the web app
# can never be uploaded to a cloud build by accident.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!worker/
!worker/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
